    "https://www.moval.edu/employment/graduate-assistant-production-assistant/": {
      "title": "Graduate Assistant, Production Assistant",
      "description": "Graduate Assistant, Production Assistant - Missouri Valley University Skip to content REQUEST INFO REQUEST INFO VISIT VISIT APPLY APPLY GIVE GIVE Employment opportunity Graduate Assistant Graduate Assistant, Production Assistant KMVC and the Viking Sports Network at Missouri Valley University invites applications for a full-time graduate assistant for a Production Assistant. Apply Now All Openings At a glance Location Schedule Full-time Department Reports to FLSA status Posted Deadline Closing date Compensation Estimated start KMVC and the Viking Sports Network at Missouri Valley University invites applications for a full-time graduate assistant for a Production Assistant. Essential Job Functions/Responsibilities Setup and execute Missouri Valley’s Viking Sports Network broadcasts, including a combination of, or all, of the following: setting up audio and video equipment, running and securing cables, verifying operations, operations, taking down equipment before, during and after broadcasts. Qualifications Completion of a Bachelor’s degree before the start of the assistantship, acceptance into an applied graduate program. All international students wishing to work must have a Social Security number Degrees involving mass communication, especially broadcast, preferred Knowledge of Missouri Valley sports, the Heart of America Athletic conference teams, the NAIA and the rules of the sports for broadcast preferred, with the understanding that mastery is an eventual requirement Excellent oral communication skills required Technologically minded, preferred. Must be able to lift 50 lbs. Must be able to work nights, weekends and holidays Application Instructions To apply, please email a letter of interest and resume to Human Resources at hr@moval.edu . Additional Information As a pre-condition of employment, the applicant must be authorized to work in the United States. Employment at MVU is contingent upon satisfactory completion of background check. O