    "https://www.moval.edu/employment/graduate-assistant-baseball/": {
      "title": "Graduate Assistant, Baseball",
      "description": "Graduate Assistant, Baseball - Missouri Valley University Skip to content REQUEST INFO REQUEST INFO VISIT VISIT APPLY APPLY GIVE GIVE Employment opportunity Graduate Assistant Graduate Assistant, Baseball The Athletic Department at Missouri Valley University invites applications for a full-time graduate assistant for the baseball program. Apply Now All Openings At a glance Location Schedule Full-time Department Reports to FLSA status Posted Deadline Closing date Compensation Estimated start The Athletic Department at Missouri Valley University invites applications for a full-time graduate assistant for the baseball program. Essential Job Functions/Responsibilities Assist in the daily functions of running a successful varsity and varsity reserve baseball program. This will include coaching, recruiting, travel arrangements, individual skill development, office administration work, and other responsibilities to be discussed. Qualifications Completion of a Bachelor’s degree before the start of the assistantship, acceptance into an applied graduate program, have a minimum of a 2.5 undergraduate GPA, or 3.0 if any graduate work has been completed prior to being hired and all international students wishing to work must have a Social Security number. Playing or coaching experience Communication skill Internet savvy and able to conduct targeted searches Social Media experience Ability to navigate recruiting databases Application Instructions to Human Resources at hr@moval.edu . Additional Information As a pre-condition of employment, the applicant must be authorized to work in the United States. Employment at MVU is contingent upon satisfactory completion of background check. Occasional evening and weekend work may be required. May require occasional overnight travel. Ready to apply? Send your application materials to: hr@moval.edu The job description lists exactly what to include. Apply Now Questions about working at MVU? Email hr@moval.edu . Equal Opp